        <argsstring>(Block &amp;B)</argsstring>
        <name>FromEdgeScan</name>
        <qualifiedname>llvm::jitlink::EHFrameCFIBlockInspector::FromEdgeScan</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="classllvm_1_1jitlink_1_1_block" kindref="compound">Block</ref> &amp;</type>
          <declname>B</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Identify CFI record type and edges based on number and order of edges in the given block only. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This assumes that the block contains one CFI record that has already been split out and fixed by the DWARFRecordSplitter and <ref refid="classllvm_1_1jitlink_1_1_e_h_frame_edge_fixer" kindref="compound">EHFrameEdgeFixer</ref> passes.</para>
<para>Zero or one outgoing edges: <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_record" kindref="compound">Record</ref> is CIE. If present, edge points to personality.</para>
<para>Two or three outgoing edges: <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_record" kindref="compound">Record</ref> is an FDE. First edge points to CIE, second to PC-begin, third (if present) to LSDA.</para>
<para>It is illegal to call this function on a block with four or more edges. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
